      <h2 id="about-learning">What I’m learning</h2>
      <p>I’m back at <a href="https://omscs.gatech.edu/">Georgia Tech</a>, where I’m currently taking <a href="https://omscs.gatech.edu/cs-6795-introduction-cognitive-science">Cognitive Science</a>. I’m also learning Spanish through <a href="https://preply.com/">Preply</a> and finding time to <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/126295152-will-chavez">read</a> whenever I can.</p>
