      <p>I’m learning Ableton Live and <a href="https://soundcloud.com/william-chavez-salinas/sets/2026-ep">making music</a> with Teenage Engineering synths. I’ve taken vocal, piano, and ensemble lessons at <a href="https://www.seattlejazzacademy.com/">Seattle Jazz Academy</a> and played piano in a <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VOtTwHimb8A">jazz quintet</a>.</p>
      <p>I’ve kept an ongoing playlist since 2018. You can find what I’m listening to on <a href="https://open.spotify.com/user/wchavezsalinas">Spotify</a> and <a href="https://music.apple.com/profile/willchavez">Apple Music</a>.</p>
